00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.280
And for those of you who were not here for
the 90s, OJ was an pro running back who most

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.780
people would agree killed his wife and her
friend and got away with it.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:50.050
There was this huge trial, it was a really
big deal, and OJ was ultimately found not-guilty,

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.020
despite a lot of evidence going against him.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:55.440
You know who else stabbed his victims to death
and got away with it?

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:56.730
That’s right.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.430
Michael Myers did that stuff.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:01.970
The only difference is that Michael didn’t
write a book about how he would have done

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:02.970
it.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.729
Forty-seven seconds into the new trailer,
there is a scene of a woman wearing a pink

00:01:05.729 --> 00:01:09.179
bathrobe with curlers in her hair making a
ham sandwich in her kitchen.

00:01:09.179 --> 00:01:12.810
Michael goes in, and comes out with the knife,
presumably after some altercation because

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.939
the chair is flipped over in the second shot.

00:01:14.939 --> 00:01:18.630
This is a remake of a scene from the original
Halloween II that came out in 1981.

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:27.630
"Harold, you want mayonnaise on your sandwich?

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:31.850
It’s also how Michael gets his knife in
that movie.

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:32.850
"...sometime early this evening.

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:36.350
Authorities have confirmed that all three
of the victims are teenagers.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:39.369
Two girls and a boy.

00:01:39.369 --> 00:01:40.579
Police have..."

00:01:40.579 --> 00:01:44.889
As you may know, the new Halloween film for
2018 is the second movie in this timeline,

00:01:44.889 --> 00:01:49.029
with Halloween II and everything that comes
after it having never taken place here.

00:01:49.029 --> 00:01:51.399
Just the original Halloween and Halloween
2018.

00:01:51.399 --> 00:01:56.029
Halloween 2018 is essentially the new Halloween
II, so it’s interesting to see events from

00:01:56.029 --> 00:02:00.729
the 1981 Halloween II are still taking place,
almost as if they were destined to happen,

00:02:00.729 --> 00:02:03.919
no matter what other events take place to
change the world line.

00:02:03.919 --> 00:02:06.779
This next one I’m not counting as one of
the Things You Missed, because there’s really

00:02:06.779 --> 00:02:10.490
no significance to it, I just thought it would
be fun to point out, but this Jack-o-Lantern

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:15.090
looks like the logo of The Smiler, a pretty
well known Infinity Coaster at Alton Towers.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:18.690
As we move up to the house, the shots here
of Michael looking through the window at what

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:22.600
appears to be a woman on the phone, could
be a reference to this scene, also from the

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:25.010
first act of the 1981 Halloween II.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:28.090
"There was someone screaming next door.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.650
Yeah, Mr. and Mrs. Elrod.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.719
His wife's always picking on him."

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:37.319
There’s also a graveyard scene in the trailer,
where a figure is spotted hiding behind a

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:38.840
tree wearing all white.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:41.799
While we don’t know for sure that this is
Michael, it would make sense.

00:02:41.799 --> 00:02:45.189
The white clothes likely indicate that he
had just escaped from the Sanitarium and headed

00:02:45.189 --> 00:02:48.950
straight for his sister’s grave just as
he does in the original Halloween, where he

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:54.150
steals his sister’s tombstone and later
uses it as a prop to display one if his killings.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.189
This time however, Laurie is going to be prepared
for Michael’s onslaught.

00:02:57.189 --> 00:03:01.329
She’s stocked up with weapons, one of which
is marked with a lightning bolt and the letters

00:03:01.329 --> 00:03:02.329
“KS”.

00:03:02.329 --> 00:03:06.819
There is a character named Kara Strode, who
is Laurie’s cousin in the 1995 film, Halloween:

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.090
The Curse of Michael Myers.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:12.469
But I think the KS is more likely pointing
to Karen Strode, Laurie’s daughter in the

00:03:12.469 --> 00:03:13.469
new continuity.

00:03:13.469 --> 00:03:15.209
Laurie even tells her daughter that she needs
to step up her security.

00:03:15.209 --> 00:03:17.200
“You have no security system Karen."

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.079
"Mom, you need help."

00:03:20.079 --> 00:03:23.819
So I think Laurie bought this gun for Karen
to protect herself, but Karen is probably

00:03:23.819 --> 00:03:27.420
hesitant to use it until later in the movie
when she actually encounters Michael and sees

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.280
why he is so dangerous.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.749
In a video I did on the previous Halloween
trailer, which you can watch right here, I

00:03:32.749 --> 00:03:36.170
pointed out that some of the trick-or-treaters
were wearing the Silver Shamrock masks from

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.299
Halloween 3.

00:03:37.299 --> 00:03:41.099
If you’re not familiar with that movie,
Silver Shamrock is an evil company that aggressively

00:03:41.099 --> 00:03:45.400
advertises and sells these children’s Halloween
masks that, when activated, cause this to

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:46.080
happen.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.040
In the new trailer, we get a better look at
the masks, and see that all three of them

00:04:04.079 --> 00:04:05.079
are present.

00:04:05.079 --> 00:04:08.480
Please keep in mind that this does not take
place in the same universe as Halloween 3,

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.430
and the appearance of these masks is probably
just an easter egg.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.870
At the end of the trailer, when Laurie is
hysterically waving the gun around, her light

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:18.790
briefly shines onto a closet, where one of
Michael’s victims has been stored on the

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:19.790
top shelf.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.010
At least he’s tidy and organized.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:23.950
I don’t think OJ Simpson can make that same
claim.

